    "macos_devices": {
      "$comment": "Raw IOKit IOHIDManager enumeration of the SAME device (macOS 2026-10-27). IOHIDManagerCopyDevices returns ONE ENTRY PER DEVICE (3 total) and reports only the primary usage page (0xFF05); the 0xFF04/0x02 collection is not separately enumerable. The difference is the API, not the OS: hidapi builds its per-collection list on top of this very same IOKit data.",
